== r3.99 (A2): Bank.Accounts.Fee must mean the module, so no variable is
== named Bank in a file that uses Bank.Accounts.
Use Bank.Accounts

Main :
    Bank := 3
    PutLn(Bank + Bank.Accounts.Fee(1))
;
